<headline>IPO FILING-Pameco Corp.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name		    Pameco Corp</p>
<p>Stock symbol			PCN.N</p>
<p>Estimated price range	   $14-$16/shr</p>
<p>Total shares to be offered *  3,075,541 Shrs offered by company	 3.0 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by shareholders    75,541</p>
<p>Class A outstanding after ipo  3,874,834 Class B outstanding	     3,983,846</p>
